      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "Mr. Ramakant Mishra submits\nthat the petitioner grievance is that the land has been acquired the construction of National\nHighway but compensation for the land as well as other amenities available in the land\ncompensation have not been paid.",
