      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "The land acquisition officer is directed to place on record proceeding and also submit copy of the notification issued under Section 3A and 3D of the National Highway Act 1956 and also clarified whether proceeding for determination of compensation has been done or not.",
